@startuml
title Diagramme de déploiement - Architecture technique de GESPRO

actor "Utilisateur\n(CEO, PM, TECH, FIN, RESADMIN)" as User

node "Poste de travail (WSL2 Ubuntu)" {
  node "Navigateur Web" as Browser {
    component "Interface Odoo\n(HTML, SCSS, JavaScript Owl)" as Frontend
  }
}

node "Serveur Odoo 18 Community" {
  component "Serveur HTTP (Werkzeug)" as HTTP
  component "Module GESPRO" as GESPRO {
    component "Modèles Python\n(annonce, appel_offre, appel, ...)" as Models
    component "Vues XML\n(formulaires, listes, dashboards)" as Views
    component "Sécurité\n(Groupes, ACL, Record Rules)" as Security
    component "Notifications\n(Chatter, Email)" as Notifications
  }
  component "Cron d'alertes\n(J-5, J-2)" as Cron
}

node "Serveur PostgreSQL 16" {
  database "Base de données\n(dbmoussa)" as DB
}

node "Serveur SMTP\n(Gmail / Mailtrap)" as SMTP

User --> Browser : Accès via HTTP
Browser --> HTTP : Requêtes HTTP
HTTP --> GESPRO : Routage Odoo
GESPRO --> DB : ORM (lecture/écriture)
Cron --> DB : Vérification périodique\n des deadlines
Notifications --> SMTP : Envoi d'emails

note right of GESPRO
  Technologies :
  - Python 3.11
  - XML, SCSS
  - JavaScript (Owl)
end note

@enduml
